{"id":"633250","name":"全麦鸡蛋水饼","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/633250/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"全麦粉","amount":"160克"},{"name":"凉水","amount":"320克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好160克全麦粉。","img":"images/633250/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"磕入2个鸡蛋。","img":"images/633250/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/633250/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱花。","img":"images/633250/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加320克凉水，搅拌均匀至无干粉，根据全麦粉不同的吸水量，可以留20克左右适当调整。","img":"images/633250/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧热，刷少许油。","img":"images/633250/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"勺入一勺面糊水，转动锅，摊平面糊，稍煎一下(全程小火)。","img":"images/633250/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻面再煎一下(全程小火)。","img":"images/633250/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"对折，再对折一下，起锅。","img":"images/633250/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘即可。","img":"images/633250/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"开吃吧。","img":"images/633250/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}